    docs: apply machine retention to aitherdev deployments
    
    Link the universal deployed-machine retention rule and require integration,
    user acceptance and explicit machine release direction before relinquishing
    aitherdev ownership. Bind the decision to exact system and application
    profile identities plus reviewed source lineage in the initiative receipts.
    
    Keep merge claims separate and preserve legacy recovery behavior without
    turning automatic archival release into permission. This changes the
    reusable operation guide only; channels, host configuration and live state
    remain unchanged.

